  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rollup | devDependencies | minor | [`1.9.0` -> `1.10.0`](https://diff.intrinsic.com/rollup/1.9.0/1.10.0) | [source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>rollup/rollup</summary>\n\n### [`v1.10.0`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;1100)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.9.3...v1.10.0)\n\n_2019-04-11_\n\n##### Features\n\n-   Improve generated code to polyfill `import.meta.url` ([#&#8203;2785](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2785))\n-   Add plugin hook to configure handling of `import.meta` ([#&#8203;2785](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2785))\n-   Improve generated code when accessing URLs of emitted assets ([#&#8203;2796](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2796))\n-   Add plugin hook to configure the generated code when accessing URLs of emitted assets ([#&#8203;2796](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2796))\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   No longer resolve assets to their parent URL in some cases ([#&#8203;2796](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2796))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2785](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2785): Refactor handling of import.meta.url and add option to configure behaviour ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2796](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2796): Improve and fix asset emission ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.9.3`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;193)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.9.2...v1.9.3)\n\n_2019-04-10_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Simplify return expressions that are evaluated before the surrounding function is bound ([#&#8203;2803](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2803))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2803](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2803): Handle out-of-order binding of identifiers to improve tree-shaking ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.9.2`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;192)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.9.1...v1.9.2)\n\n_2019-04-10_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Allowing replacing `output.file` with `output.dir` in the `outputOptions` hook ([#&#8203;2802](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2802))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2802](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2802): Observe modified output options in bundle.write ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.9.1`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;191)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.9.0...v1.9.1)\n\n_2019-04-10_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Make sure inline comments in dynamic imports are preserved ([#&#8203;2797](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2797))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2797](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2797): Emit inline comments inside dynamic import ([@&#8203;manucorporat](https://togithub.com/manucorporat))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
